          <p style="margin: 8px 0 2px;"><img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="Full viewport for comment 2" width="640" style="max-width: 100%;" /></p>
